format: weir-signal/1
signal: release/acme/1.0#1
kind: ask
asserted_by: acme
assertion: acme 1.0 is released, and the repository pins 0.9.
subjects: release
subjects: acme
argues_with: packages/acme/default.nix
excerpt: acme 1.0 is out.
position: release notes, the first line

format: weir-signal/1
signal: release/acme/1.0#2
kind: constraint
asserted_by: acme
assertion: acme 1.0 drops the old shim.
subjects: acme
excerpt: The old shim is gone.
position: release notes, under Removed

format: weir-signal/1
signal: release/acme/1.0#3
kind: question
asserted_by: acme
assertion: Whether the pin is kept for the shim.
excerpt: Pin 0.9 if you need the shim.
position: release notes, under Upgrading
